ame content  can be played and enjoyed without needing to buy expensive DLC's all the time", "timestamp_created": 1771664739, "timestamp_updated": 1771664739, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.501084625720977783", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1719730800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "218842130", "author": {"steamid": "76561198134003371", "personaname": "ChangelingFox", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/ChangelingFox/", "num_games_owned": 499, "num_reviews": 56, "playtime_forever": 6623, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 6378, "last_played": 1771908626, "avatar": "c2dfe75f7d50f0aafc4a84c3dc84c23bccdf132b"}, "language": "english", "review": "This one is better than what you might expect. Very f2p friendly system. More grind, less gacha. Story is fun, a rather typical post-apocalyptic/alien invasion flick. \r\nIt's rather easy to get all the Steam achievements to add to 100% games list. \r\nOne HUGE con - if your country is way far from EU/US lag will drive you insane. The way the game connects us is a backend nightmare. No choice of a server as in typical MMOs. You might want to use ExitLag if you like the game so much as to farm weapon/character and focus on builds. After story endgame grind is... well, a grind. \r\nOverall good experience. Getting characters/weapons is way easier than ZZZ/Wuthering Waves kind of system.", "timestamp_created": 1771658302, "timestamp_updated": 1771658302, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.477460235357284546", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1719730800", "reactions": []}]}